superFetch = {import:super-fetch-plugin}
uploadPlugin = {import:upload-plugin}
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  DOMINION CARD CATALOG — compiled main.pjs
//  The complete card catalog as a Perchance list, compiled from
//  bgn-dominion-expansion-dev-harness (src/data/*.json) plus the
//  official card list at dominionstrategy.com/all-cards, plus the
//  Dominion Strategy wiki (archived) for Menagerie → Rising Sun.
//  (Base through Rising Sun + promotional cards; 560 cards total.)
//  One list item per card. Child fields:
//    name       — display name
//    cost       — coin cost (number)
//    potion     — potion-in-cost flag (1 = costs a Potion)
//    debt       — debt cost (number; Empires debt cards, e.g. Overlord)
//    types      — sublist of card types (Action/Treasure/Victory/...)
//                 (read it in JS with card.types.$allKeys)
//    treasure   — coins produced when played (Treasures only)
//    vp         — base Victory points (Victory cards only)
//    text       — official effect text
//    expansion  — set id (base/intrigue/seaside/alchemy/prosperity/
//                 cornucopia/hinterlands/dark-ages/guilds/adventures/
//                 empires/nocturne/renaissance/menagerie/allies/
//                 plunder/rising-sun/promo)
//    inSupply   — forms a supply pile (false for non-supply cards)
//    pileSize   — default supply count (number), or a sublist with
//                 p2 = <count at 2 players>, p3 = <count at 3+ players>
//    startDeck  — copies in each player's starting deck (if any)
//  Browse it in JS via root.dominionCards
